{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a1-fishing-spirits/audio/main-5610d831203c.mp3","durationSec":175.488,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":3.54,"text":"Fishing Spirits started in Japan in November 2012."},{"start":4.44,"end":8.66,"text":"In 2015, the machines came to other countries as Ace Angler."},{"start":9.32,"end":11.04,"text":"You stand around the machine with other people."},{"start":11.6,"end":14.46,"text":"You all see fish in the same water on the screen."},{"start":14.98,"end":16.62,"text":"This is where the machine shows the game."},{"start":17.5,"end":21.54,"text":"In Japan, the first home game came out in July 2019."},{"start":22.34,"end":23.72,"text":"You play it on Nintendo Switch."},{"start":24.6,"end":25.6,"text":"This game was popular."},{"start":26.26,"end":29.02,"text":"People bought more than 850,000 copies."},{"start":29.48,"end":31.08,"text":"A copy is one game."},{"start":32.2,"end":34.96,"text":"Another home game is Ace Angler: Fishing Spirits."},{"start":35.76,"end":39.42,"text":"It came out in the United States on 28 October 2022."},{"start":40.3,"end":43.32,"text":"It is from Bandai Namco Entertainment, a game company."},{"start":43.96,"end":45.8,"text":"These people make and sell games."},{"start":46.4,"end":47.9,"text":"You play it on Nintendo Switch."},{"start":48.62,"end":52.64,"text":"This small game machine is for playing by yourself or with friends."},{"start":53.14,"end":56.3,"text":"You hold a fishing rod, a long thing for getting fish."},{"start":56.86,"end":58.6,"text":"Move it to put your line in the water."},{"start":59.38,"end":61.56,"text":"The line goes from the thing you hold to the fish."},{"start":61.56,"end":63.36,"text":"A fish takes the food."},{"start":64.12,"end":66.52,"text":"Turn the reel, a small thing by your hand."},{"start":67.18,"end":68.62,"text":"This brings the fish to you."},{"start":69.14,"end":71.66,"text":"The thing you hold moves when the fish takes the food."},{"start":72.08,"end":73.34,"text":"The fish pulls in the game."},{"start":73.8,"end":75.44,"text":"This makes the reel hard to turn."},{"start":76.22,"end":79.3,"text":"Your hands feel this, so getting a fish feels like work."},{"start":80.24,"end":82.7,"text":"You can give the fish an electric shock with a button."},{"start":83.6,"end":85.32,"text":"Electricity hits the fish in the game."},{"start":85.96,"end":87.96,"text":"Electricity is what makes lights work."},{"start":87.96,"end":91.68,"text":"The shock makes the fish weaker, so it is easier to get."},{"start":92.36,"end":93.98,"text":"Each time, you use one point."},{"start":94.48,"end":95.68,"text":"The game is easy to learn."},{"start":96.3,"end":97.54,"text":"You move your hands to play."},{"start":98.18,"end":99.86,"text":"It feels like getting a real fish."},{"start":100.46,"end":102.44,"text":"At first, you see dark fish in the water."},{"start":103.06,"end":104.88,"text":"You cannot see which fish it is yet."},{"start":105.42,"end":106.28,"text":"It takes the food."},{"start":107.2,"end":108.82,"text":"Then you see which fish it is."},{"start":109.14,"end":110.78,"text":"You get points when you get a fish."},{"start":111.54,"end":113.42,"text":"These are numbers you win in the game."},{"start":114,"end":116.94,"text":"A fish that is hard to get gives you more."},{"start":118.16,"end":120.2,"text":"There are three places with different fish."},{"start":120.98,"end":124.06,"text":"You see new fish when the game moves to another place."},{"start":124.98,"end":127.8,"text":"You can get a small fish or a very big one."},{"start":129.1,"end":131.8,"text":"In the home game, you get medals when you play."},{"start":132.66,"end":135.82,"text":"These are small things you use like money in the game."},{"start":136.52,"end":139.26,"text":"You use them in another game machine to get new fish."},{"start":140.1,"end":142.1,"text":"You do not choose which fish you get."},{"start":142.74,"end":144.66,"text":"These fish go into your aquarium."},{"start":145.38,"end":147.6,"text":"This is a home for fish that people can look at."},{"start":147.6,"end":151.78,"text":"There are more than 250 kinds of fish to get."},{"start":152.44,"end":154.66,"text":"A kind is a group of the same fish."},{"start":155.56,"end":157.72,"text":"You can watch the fish and learn about them."},{"start":158.34,"end":159.7,"text":"You can get a shark, too."},{"start":160.54,"end":162.72,"text":"This is a big sea fish with many teeth."},{"start":163.78,"end":166.52,"text":"There are short games for your family and friends, too."},{"start":166.9,"end":169.24,"text":"You can also play with people who are not near you."},{"start":169.69,"end":172.38,"text":"In the story, you help make dirty seas clean again."},{"start":172.94,"end":175.02,"text":"You play to help the fish have clean water."}],"words":[{"text":"Fishing","start":0,"end":0.28},{"text":"Spirits","start":0.28,"end":0.64},{"text":"started","start":0.64,"end":1.22},{"text":"in","start":1.22,"end":1.48},{"text":"Japan","start":1.48,"end":1.82},{"text":"in","start":1.82,"end":2.16},{"text":"November","start":2.16,"end":2.5},{"text":"2012","start":2.5,"end":3.54},{"text":"In","start":4.44,"end":4.56},{"text":"2015","start":4.56,"end":5.18},{"text":"the","start":5.94,"end":5.98},{"text":"machines","start":5.98,"end":6.32},{"text":"came","start":6.32,"end":6.64},{"text":"to","start":6.64,"end":6.82},{"text":"other","start":6.82,"end":7.08},{"text":"countries","start":7.08,"end":7.46},{"text":"as","start":7.46,"end":7.84},{"text":"Ace","start":7.84,"end":8.18},{"text":"Angler","start":8.18,"end":8.66},{"text":"You","start":9.32,"end":9.46},{"text":"stand","start":9.46,"end":9.72},{"text":"around","start":9.72,"end":9.96},{"text":"the","start":9.96,"end":10.1},{"text":"machine","start":10.1,"end":10.32},{"text":"with","start":10.32,"end":10.5},{"text":"other","start":10.5,"end":10.7},{"text":"people","start":10.7,"end":11.04},{"text":"You","start":11.6,"end":11.7